# Copy this file to .env and fill in the values from your Supabase project's
# Settings -> API page. The anon key is safe to expose client-side (it's the
# public key, protected by Row Level Security policies on the tables) but
# should still not be committed here - keep real values in .env only.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
